'''Alolan Persian''' (Japanese: '''アローラペルシアン''' ''Alolan Persian'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

