==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Persian}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Alolan Persian|79}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
*{{a|Fur Coat}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Persian can have.
*'''Claw Slash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|XY Promo|Sableye|92}}, one of the {{TCG|XY Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

